VITE_API_BASE_URL=# Base URL to use for backend calls
VITE_LICHTING_IMAGES_PATH=# Base path of the images to show on the homepage, relative to the API base URL
VITE_LICHTING_IMAGES=# Filenames of the images to show on the homepage, separated by ',' and in order
VITE_AUTHORIZATION_URL_ENDPOINT_PATH=# Path to the endpoint for generating authorization URL's, relative to the API base URL
